# MaCSad admin application

Import AdminHeader from "./admin_header.lg".
Import BoardWorkspace from "./board_workspace.lg".
Import ReadOnlyPanels from "./read_only_panels.lg".

The shell owns only primary navigation. Each child component owns the state and
styles of the administrative job it renders.

## Component MacsAdAdmin:
    Let currentView be a signal "Board".
    View:
        css "* { box-sizing: border-box; } .app-shell { min-height: 100vh; color: #14202b; background: #f2f0e9; font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; } .workspace { min-height: calc(100vh - 74px); display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; } .sidebar { flex: 1 1 224px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(150px,1fr)); align-content: start; gap: 6px; padding: 30px 18px; background: #e8e5db; border-right: 1px solid #d4d0c4; } .eyebrow { grid-column: 1 / -1; margin: 0 10px 7px; color: #66737c; font: 700 10px/1.2 ui-monospace, monospace; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; } .nav-button { width: 100%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin: 0; padding: 12px 13px; color: #253746; background: transparent; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 10px; font: 650 13px/1.2 inherit; text-align: left; cursor: pointer; } .nav-button:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,.7); border-color: #d5d1c5; } .nav-button span { color: #7b878d; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; } .sidebar-note { grid-column: 1 / -1; margin: 24px 5px 0; padding: 16px; color: #3f4e57; background: #f7f4ec; border: 1px solid #d7d2c5; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.55; } .sidebar-note strong { display: block; margin-bottom: 6px; color: #102c3b; } .main { flex: 999 1 600px; min-width: 0; padding: clamp(24px,4vw,54px); overflow: hidden; } button:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #16758a; outline-offset: 3px; } @media (max-width: 820px) { .workspace { display: block; } .sidebar { grid-template-columns: repeat(4,1fr); padding: 10px; border-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #d4d0c4; } .eyebrow, .sidebar-note { display: none; } .nav-button { justify-content: center; padding: 10px 5px; font-size: 11px; } .nav-button span { display: none; } }"
        div [class="app-shell"]:
            AdminHeader
            div [class="workspace"]:
                aside [class="sidebar"]:
                    p [class="eyebrow"]: "Workspace"
                    button [class="nav-button"]:
                        on click:
                            Set currentView to "Board".
                        strong: "Board"
                        span: "01"
                    button [class="nav-button"]:
                        on click:
                            Set currentView to "Organization".
                        strong: "Organization"
                        span: "02"
                    button [class="nav-button"]:
                        on click:
                            Set currentView to "Research".
                        strong: "Research"
                        span: "03"
                    button [class="nav-button"]:
                        on click:
                            Set currentView to "Operations".
                        strong: "Operations"
                        span: "04"
                    div [class="sidebar-note"]:
                        strong: "Guardrail"
                        span: "This baseline exposes no mutation route. A local draft is not durable work."
                main [class="main"]:
                    when currentView is equal to "Board":
                        BoardWorkspace
                    when currentView is equal to "Organization":
                        OrganizationPanel
                    when currentView is equal to "Research":
                        ResearchPanel
                    when currentView is equal to "Operations":
                        OperationsPanel
